  "_offeringSignalsComment": "Commerce markers that identify a block as a product listing rather than a person. Used as a second line of defence for Key People: a heading sitting next to 'Regular price' or 'Add to cart' is a product, whatever its capitalisation looks like. These describe the surrounding MARKUP context, not the words in the name itself — guessing that 'Techno Sword Earrings' sounds product-ish would be exactly the content-shape guessing this system avoids.",
