  "_pricingModelsComment": "SMB sites state price far more often as a MODEL than as a number — the reference profiles in Knowledge_Outputs are dominated by 'Per Project', 'By Quote/Estimate' and 'Included with monitoring service', with barely a currency figure among them. A currency-only regex returns null for almost all of them, so these phrases are matched too. The literal matched text is stored, never normalised: 'Free Inspection' and '$0' are not the same claim.",
